{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b1c0a7d2-4f6e-4a3b-9c1d-5a2e7f8b9c01",
    "name": "SalesGenie AI - Team C",
    "description": "API collection for the SalesGenie AI backend (Team C).\n\nRun order: Auth -> Prospects -> Import -> Intelligence -> Outreach -> Scoring -> Conversations -> Analytics -> CRM.\n\nThe Auth request stores `token`; Create prospect stores `lead_id`; Generate outreach stores `campaign_id`; CRM sync stores `log_id`.\n\nExpected non-2xx results that are correct by design:\n- POST /api/v1/outreach/send -> 501 email_transport_not_configured (SRS D-05)\n- POST /api/v1/crm/sync -> 501 crm_not_configured (SRS D-06)\n- Create duplicate prospect -> 409 duplicate_lead\n\nSelect the `SalesGenie AI - Local` environment before running.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Issue token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('access token returned', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "{{email}}" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "{{password}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/token", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "token"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Who am I",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('profile has a role', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().role).to.be.oneOf(['admin','manager','rep','viewer']));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"] }
          }
